Interview-la production-ready AI agents epdi build pannuvinga, LLM CDN pathi sollunga-nu ketta, indha answer sollunga!

Pona video-la RAG plus JEV pathi pathom. Pakalana adhayum paarunga!

Production-la AI agent build pannumbodhu, first agent venuma-nu decide pannunga. Predictable workflow-na normal code podhum. Flexible decision-making thevaipatta dhaan agent!

Agent-ku oru clear responsibility kudukkanum. Thevaiyana tools mattum expose pannanum. LLM decision edukattum, but execution and validation deterministic code-la irukkanum.

State-ah model memory-la mattum vechuka koodadhu. External-ah store pannanum. Sensitive actions-ku human approval, retries, timeouts, limits and tracing kandipa venum!

Idhu dhaan production-ready agent engineering!

Next, LLM CDN!

Oru user same question repeated-ah ketta, every time LLM-ku full request send panni generate panna latency-um cost-um increase aagum.

Caching use pannina, eligible repeated requests-ku previous result reuse pannalaam. Aana exact cache, semantic cache, prompt caching — idhellam different!

Especially semantic cache-la similar question-na same answer-nu blindly assume pannakoodadhu. Context, freshness and user-specific data check pannanum.

Agent reliability-ku engineering principles. Repeated work reduce panna caching. Idhu dhaan production thinking!
